<title>FINLAND: SENTRA SWINGS TO FIM 19.6 MLN PROFIT.</title>
<headline>SENTRA SWINGS TO FIM 19.6 MLN PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to end-February,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, tax	   19.6 vs 16.6 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					  774.5 vs 694.8</p>
<p> Operating profit				  16.4 vs 4.5 loss</p>
<p>Note -- Full name of Finnish wholesaler and retailer is Sentra</p>
<p>Oy. The company said in a statement it will release its year to</p>
<p>end-February 1997 financial statement on April 22.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newroom +358 - 9 - 680 5 240</p>
</text>
